    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Wish Magic.</strong> As a Magic action, you can cast a level 1 spell of your choice from the Sorcerer spell list that has a casting time of an action. Once you use this benefit, you can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest. Its spellcasting ability is the ability increased by this feat.</p><p>At character level 11, the spell you cast with this feat is cast as if with a level 2 spell slot; at character level 17, as if with a level 3 spell slot.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-cRoc9btVWf0KOKxb\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Wish Magic spends its use; cast the chosen Sorcerer spell from the compendium at the slot level of your character level (1, then 2 at level 11, 3 at level 17), without spending a slot.</p></section>",
